<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="TIT" style="id">- Alkitab Bahasa Ansus</book>
  <para style="h">Titusi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tit.</para>
  <para style="toc2">Titusi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Weraung na Paulusi we Titusi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Weraung Na Paulusi We</para>
  <para style="mt1">Titusi</para>
  <para style="is1">Kawio Aduna we Titusi</para>
  <para style="ip">Titusi mamo nyontarai Yaudi dina wa, mana piana rioao Yesusi to. Paulusi yauwi we ne maniwowi we undupi kuira kong we mampata we Paulusi na mariwa nyari pa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Arera nini pai Paulusi soi we Titusi na raora Kretapai tutu i demi nyaina yana we deung jemaat na yana pai. Na arera nini pai Paulusi derekamana parari pipa toru we Titusi dong pararia:</para>
  <para style="ip">Retenang peino Paulusi derekamang Titusi parari topitotoi nyontarai we entiri ya we embedung na jemaati pa. Paulusi derekamang piyana pa tutu nyontarai na Kreta paya empau etong mamuna.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kodu peino, Paulusi denyau Titusi parari topitotoi andi denyau rabuang paya na jemaati pa, aino rabuang muang paya kong wawing we embepaituang paya imbaro ya andi entanyau we emayea paya warui ya pa. Kong rabuang embe aimiomang paya, kong we embe woming paya.</para>
  <para style="ip">Titusi tato Paulusi denyauwi parari topitotoi nyontarai Kristeng paya andi embeng pa. Piwe retenang na piyana pa aino andi emanaang kong emadori, endeo esanerire nyontarai pe, kong endeo esanewe etong amuna pe ete endeo etong nyontarai embateta ya pe.</para>
  <para style="iot">Kawio na weraung nei kiutua tonina:</para>
  <para style="io1">Kawio retenang. <char style="ior"><ref loc="TIT 1:1-4">1:1-4</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">We emariwa na jemaati paya. <char style="ior"><ref loc="TIT 1:5-16">1:5-16</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Anyau we nari parari we weng pa. <char style="ior"><ref loc="TIT 2:1-15">2:1-15</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Anyau parari nyontarai Kristeng paya embeng toa pa. <char style="ior"><ref loc="TIT 3:1-11">3:1-11</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kawio wepui. <char style="ior"><ref loc="TIT 3:12-15">3:12-15</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="TIT 1" />
  <para style="s">Tabea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 1:1" />Wu neu kumai Titusi au. Weraung nini na yau Paulusi, woming we Allai kong rasuri we Kristus Yesusi. Allai diri yau kong demi yau we epata nyontarai Allai diri ya eampa ya, imbaromi endoaoa pa maitui. Yau tato epata ya endearoang anyau wetarai pai imbaro esomi we Allai na wemai, <verse eid="TIT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 1:2" />mae esanesara we ingkai etadu wieng ki woroi-woroi pa. Wieng ki woroi yanipai Allai piana derekamana na awe nyari nunei wami, we ingkai nyontarai ne tataduta kong piyana pa Allai weangkari wa. <verse eid="TIT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 1:3" />Na awe Allai aneweapa, I piana denyawi na ne Arera pai na Arera Weweng pa wu tata ma. Arera Weweng yani pai Allai, tane Mampariripai rioaoa wu yau kong demi yau ewuwua.<verse eid="TIT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 1:4" />Tituse au, eyau au we neu kumai di au tutu roao Kristus Yesusi mai parari eroaoi pa. Yai Allai kong Yesus Kristusi, tane Mampariri pai urong une weweng urona pinoma pa wu au kong urong au bodu we madoripa kong untinti au.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 8:23">2Kor. 8:23</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:3">Gal. 2:3</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:10">2Tim. 4:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="TIT 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi denyau Titusi parari mariwa riu na nu Kreta pai.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 1:5" />Yau yong au naina nutakutu Kreta pai imbaromi au nuari mariwa we unaria kaipa wa, we andi nuari pararia ra mai. Kong we imbaromi au ruwa nyontarai peaya we embedung we jemaati paya na bendaripa kai. Kong remuaroang pitoai yerera we aupa nina aino: <verse eid="TIT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 1:6" />We embedung we jemaati paya mamo enari pisarara pa wa, endidau mamo ene wawing koiri ki, ene kumai paya endoao Kristusi to, kong nyontarai peaya entubakepang ya tutu enari piwe maiwa pa, ete embengpa emaidai etong parari we piyana pa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 3:2-7">1Tim. 3:2-7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="TIT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 1:7" />Wo we embedung we jemaati paya mamo, Allai rioao ya we eteung jemaati paya. Impaina enari pisarara pa wa, esanerarong tedai wa, engkayou pampinoma wa, etunung emaeru wa, emarowa wa kong endewe pe wa. <verse eid="TIT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 1:8" />Mana embarami pa tapia we empata nyontarai, emararising we enari pi wemai pa, esanekurayang, esanerarong wemai, esanerarong memarang, kong endearoang enetarai pai. <verse eid="TIT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 1:9" />Endu kawio wetarai pa na maitui, parariapi anyau we piana tatanyauwa weya pa, imbaromi ya empaya we etanyau nyontarai parari anyau yana kong empaya we engkawio kangkuna we nyontarai we entatipa ya pa. <verse eid="TIT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 1:10" />Tutu nyontarai pa empau entantipa wemai pa kong embuwu kawio wetarai pa wa, retenang pei na nyontarai we endu mamba parari sunati paya. Na kawio entopang pinomapa ya embeangkari nyontarai peaya. <verse eid="TIT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 1:11" />Nyontarai toyana paya andi mia mengkawung esorengpa, tutu ya etauamuna we mandarong pitau na anyau wemai wa. Enari toyana we etadu pi we kio mamaya pa. <verse eid="TIT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 1:12" />Nyontarai pei na ya, esawi we ene nabi dina, iwo na nu Kreta pai, na pampong sopang parari ya doyo, “Nyontarai Kreta paya mamo embeangkari barui, emparari piaung emamuna we etampi barui kong emaidai endupi.” <verse eid="TIT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 1:13" />Pitoai nabipai sopana pa tarai, impaina wua ya na kangkuna, imbaro ya endoao anyau wetaraipa na maitui <verse eid="TIT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 1:14" />kong endeo endu Yaudipa ene arari we maiwapa pe ete mambao nyontarai we embateta anyau we taraipa enaripa pe. <verse eid="TIT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 1:15" />Wo we nyontarai esanerarong pai mamarang paya pipatotoi kia enari pa mamarang. Mana we nyontarai engkararia paya kong endoaoa wa paya pipatotoi kia enaripa mamarang wa, tutu esanerarongpa kong esanetatuata pa kararia. <verse eid="TIT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="TIT 1:16" />Ya endeo endoao Allai mana na pi enari pa, denyawa we ya empampora I. Ya engkararia kong entuang we Allai wa kong empaya wa we enari pi we mai pa.<verse eid="TIT 1:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="TIT 2" />
  <para style="s">Anyau we paituang paya, aimomang paya kong woming paya parari pitoai enari pa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 2:1" />Mana Titusi au mamo andi bonyau anyau wetarai pa. <verse eid="TIT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 2:2" />Bonyau muang we embe paituang paya, imbaro endeo etongpampinong ya pe, ya esanekurayang, embeng na wemai imbaro nyontarai esomi weya. Endoaoa na wetarai, na esanewiwu nyontarai kong esanerarongpa maitui na etadu didiwa pa. <verse eid="TIT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 2:3" />Toyana tato we wawing embe paituang paya, bonyau ya imbaro na embengpa esomi we Seni. Endeo engkangkani nyontarai pe, etunung barui angguri pe, mana ya andi emainuanung entanyau pi wemai pa <verse eid="TIT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 2:4" />kong na toyana pa, ya empaya we etanyau wawing emaiyea pa we esanewiwu ene muang paya kong ene kumai paya, <verse eid="TIT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 2:5" />esanekurayang kong embe mamarang, entongsaiwa ene mandarongpai na wemai, entuang we ene muang paya. Na toyana pa nyontarai peaya engkangkani Allai ne Arera pa wa.<verse eid="TIT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 2:6" />Toyana tato we aimiomang paya, bonyau ya imbaromi empaya we entampi wemoya wa pa. <verse eid="TIT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 2:7" />Kong au tato andi we pianyawa na wemai weya na pitoiai nuaripa. Bonyau mamo bonyau na pitarai kong na anemurarong wemai. <verse eid="TIT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 2:8" />Bonyau tera pi kawio wetarai pa imbaro nyontarai embemarowa we aupa paya emamaya tutu ya etadu pisarara pea we engkawio wemoyawa parari tata wa.<verse eid="TIT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 2:9" />Woming paya bonyau ya we andi esomi we ene tuang paya, kong etong ene tuang paya esanerarong pa merarising na pipatotoi, ya embateta ene tuang paya pe. <verse eid="TIT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 2:10" />Endeo emanana ene tuang pa pienempa pe, mana ya enukepana na wemai kong entuang we ene tuang paya. Imbaro na toyana pa nyontarai neya kuira entaparanding Allai, tane Mampariri pai ne anyau pa.<verse eid="TIT 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 2:11" />Tutu Allai ne weweng dona pinoma we periri nyontarai neya kuira pa piana denyawa to. <verse eid="TIT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 2:12" />I denyau tata imbaro tampika weunawa pa kong pi nunei ne awiapa kong imbaro tambengne tasanekurayang, tasanerarong mei kong tasomi we Allai meari na nunei nina pa. <verse eid="TIT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 2:13" />Kong tasanesara na maitui tatamang we a Baba Memarang pai, awe tane Mampariri Yesus Kristusi, aino Allai we Beba raweina pai, teweri to nunei na ne dea wetedai rarong pa emapa. <verse eid="TIT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 2:14" />I andi dong netaraipai we tata we periri tata tangkai kuira warui tane sasari wemoyawa pai kong nyari tata tamamarang kong riuwa tata we ne kumai kong tantapira pitarai we tanari piwe maipa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5">Kel. 19:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:20">Ul. 4:20</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 7:6">7:6</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 14:2">14:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 130:8">Mzm. 130:8</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:9">1Ptr. 2:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="TIT 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 2:15" />Topang piyanapa kai, bonyau kong wua nyontarai paya parari mambiri we boduta pa. Bong parari piyanapa na wemai imbaro remo nyontarai pei anepapi au pe.<verse eid="TIT 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="TIT 3" />
  <para style="s">Arera we wepuipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="TIT 3:1" />Kowio kangkuna we jemaat paya imbaro ya entuang we weembedung na parenta pai kong we weendu anong mananu paya, entuang weya kong enari mariwa weweng pa. <verse eid="TIT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="TIT 3:2" />Engkangkani nyontarai pe, etong amuna pe, mana ya esanerarong weng we nyontarai paya kuira. <verse eid="TIT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="TIT 3:3" />Tutu pampompa tata tato tambeng na wetata pa, tantuang we Allai wa, tandoao pi wetarai pa wa, tamirising we tanari pi weunawa pa, tasanetatua pi wemoyawa pa, tantatipa nyontarai. <verse eid="TIT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="TIT 3:4" />Mana Allai, tane Mampariripai denyawa we tata anewiwu pa kong anerarong weng we nyontarai ne tata pa. <verse eid="TIT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="TIT 3:5" />I periri tata pa mamo tutu tatong wetaraipa wa, mana tutu mantauni ne anewiwu tata pa. I periri tata na Duainunung Mamarang pai ne mambiri pa, kong dupipi tata, dong tata tampika tane wemoyawa pa, kong tamparari kumai we etawing ya embaworu. <verse eid="TIT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="TIT 3:6" />Na pitoai Yesus Kristusi tane Mampariripai nyaripa donane Allai dong Duainunung Mamarang pai we tata, <verse eid="TIT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="TIT 3:7" />imbaro na Allai ne weweng dona pinoma we tata pa, tane haki we tatadu wieng ki woroi-woroi pa, parari we tasanesara pa. <verse eid="TIT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="TIT 3:8" />Kawio nina pa wetarai impaina yoyo kowio kangkuna, imbaro nyontarai we piana endoao Allai paya etongsaera kangkuna we enari mariwa weweng pa. Yanaino weng kong mai we nyontarai nea kuira pa. <verse eid="TIT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="TIT 3:9" />Mana pika nemutaraipai warui kawio we kio amuna we maiwa pa, kong warui arari parari ene mandarong pai riana mapa, warui marowa parari Kawio Musai soi pai, tutu piyana pa mai wa kong kio piwe mai pea wa. <verse eid="TIT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="TIT 3:10" />Nyontarai we dona mamo jemaati paya entatipa ya pa, andi bonyau nyontarai yani, we retenang, we kodu tarao au wa mamo pika nemutaraipai warui i. <verse eid="TIT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="TIT 3:11" />Remuaroana we nyontarai toyana pai tarai ria arara pa to mae na ne sasaripai kio mambabati pa we netaraipai.<verse eid="TIT 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="TIT 3:12" />Na awe yemi Artemasi ete Tikhikusi dontara dedu aupa mamo, bosaera we bonta we yau to bendari Nikopolisi ema, tutu ekutua we enai na nu yani pai na awe wanang wiaera ne aidu pai nini.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Kis. 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:21-22">Ef. 6:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:7-8">Kol. 4:7-8</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:12">2Tim. 4:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="TIT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="TIT 3:13" />Bosaera na kangkuna we puata Senasi, nyontarai anemanuainung na mambapai kong Apolosi asaru na awe uronta pa, imbaromi uradu aseung pea wa mana uronta na wemai.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:24">Kis. 18:24</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 16:12">1Kor. 16:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="TIT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="TIT 3:14" />Kong bonyau tane nyontarai paya imbaro etosaera we enari mariwa we maipa we empata nyontarai eaya we ene pianeawa paya, imbaro remo ene embengpa weunawa pe.<verse eid="TIT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tabea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="TIT 3:15" />Neta we enai kuira kong yau na nina neya etong tabea we au kong topana we neta we tandoaoa kuira paya, we esanewiwu ama paya we amatong tabea weya tato.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="TIT 3:15">Wento Seni dong ne weweng dona pinoma pa we mia. <figure style="fig" file="AN2 Israel at the time of Jesus.png" size="span" loc="3:15" ref="3:15" /><verse eid="TIT 3:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="TIT 3" />
</usx>